<p><strong>Anyone can submit an idea.</strong> No technical knowledge, coding experience or build required. Go solo or submit as a team.</p>
<p>If your idea is selected, advisors will help you bring it to life.</p>
<div class="submission-inspiration">
  <p><strong>The challenge: imagine something that communicates Great Lakes water-quality data or showcases the lake’s movement.</strong> Think lights, sound, an interactive display or a moving sculpture that brings lake data to life.</p>
  <p>Your idea could highlight good versus concerning water-temperature or current-speed conditions, or showcase changing wave patterns through an Arduino-controlled sculpture. You only need to submit the idea now; no working build or technical knowledge is required.</p>
